      "value": "@{62def87167455d44a141e91e|full_name}: Something helpful that I should add while testing the v50 browser while running VRChat:\n\nSometimes, VRChat will send me to my home world due to running out of memory while running the browser. A lot of stuff happening at once! I found out that I can mitigate this issue if I enable Panic/Safety mode.",
