  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When clicking on an external URL (such as a link on someone's profile), it was normal behavior for the VRChat client to close. Meta has since pushed out the v50 system update, which now allows the Internet Browser to be opened while using any application.\n\nUnfortunately, VRChat still closes upon opening an external URL instead of opening up the system dashboard and using the browser while the client is running.",
